The SLC603 ZigBee Wireless Dimmer Switch provides wireless on/off control, brightness dimming and color temperature tuning. It is easy to install or adhere anywhere in the house.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA1.2 and ZLL compliant
- Wireless on/off switch
- Brightness dimmer
- Color temperature tuner
- Easy to install or adhere anywhere in the house
- Extremely low power consumption, 2 x AAA batteries
